{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":false,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":false,"translated":true},"context":"effective-interest-rate-calculator UI copy.howAnswer","detected_language":"zh","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer","keys":["effective-interest-rate-calculator.copy.howAnswer"],"locale":"zh-CN","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"对于周期性复合,APY = (ZXQPH0000QXZ + APR ÷ m)^m − ZXQPH0001QXZ,其中 m 是每年复合期数。 要将 APY 转换回名义 APR,请使用 APR = m × ((ZXQPH0002QXZ + APY)^(ZXQPH0003QXZ/m) − ZXQPH0004QXZ ) 。 连续复合使用 APY = e^APR − ZXQPH0005QXZ。","record_id":"c32c8a8c211bd13b3d194e6adaff7a078ae0011531df9b9f2b24a2fe623598bd","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40565692987","seconds":3.1317627521249847,"source":"For periodic compounding, APY = (1 + APR ÷ m)^m − 1, where m is the number of compounding periods per year. To convert APY back to nominal APR, use APR = m × ((1 + APY)^(1/m) − 1). Continuous compounding uses APY = e^APR − 1. Enter rates as percentages; for example, 12 means 12%.","source_commit":"e8a7cb94dc75d40f2c0e14bb27c0a1819e230012","source_hash":"fe78b074adbd1d99e0a797d7cf4aab3016d94b38ff9812d5eef74ae6613339fa","status":"needs-review","translation":"对于周期性复合,APY = (ZXQPH0000QXZ + APR ÷ m)^m − ZXQPH0001QXZ,其中 m 是每年复合期数。 要将 APY 转换回名义 APR,请使用 APR = m × ((ZXQPH0002QXZ + APY)^(ZXQPH0003QXZ/m) − ZXQPH0004QXZ ) 。 连续复合使用 APY = e^APR − ZXQPH0005QXZ。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
